<title>HUNGARY: Budapest Stock Exchange closed, opens on Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Budapest Stock Exchange closed, opens on Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange, as is closed on Friday and will reopen on Monday, January 6.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
